  "description": "WRITE-FAIL with a killed holder (process death while another owned actor remains). Process a BeginTrans, updates N of row 1 (uncommitted) and holds a pessimistic Edit on row 40, then signals and waits. Process b tries updates of rows 1 and 40 (Errors before/after, expected 3260), kills a (TerminateProcess, own worker), waits 1.5 s and tries both again, then pauses 7 s, Idle and reads rows 1 and 40 with a final fresh open. Asks how long a dead holder's locks and lock-file entry last and whether the uncommitted change is gone.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
